OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after cyclist dies in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a cyclist
OL,7,Fdied following a collision with a car
OL,8,Fin North Yorkshire.
OL,10,FThe crash between the cyclist and a
OL,11,Fblue Volvo XC60 took place on Alne Road
OL,12,Fin Easingwold at about 17:00 BST on
OL,13,FFriday and the cyclist, a 60-year-old
OL,14,Fman, died at the scene, North Yorkshire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe force confirmed the driver of the
OL,18,FVolvo, a 39-year-old man, was arrested
OL,19,Fin connection with the incident and has
OL,20,Fsince been released while inquiries
OL,21,Fcontinue.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
